ng from rooftops and trees. Red, gold, and green hues dominate the color palette, lending a festive and celebratory vibe to the scene.\n\nIn the foreground, a paved street lined with blooming pink cherry blossom trees and lantern posts leads toward the central gate of the grand structure. Numerous people, dressed in traditional robes or attire from an ancient era, walk the streets, engaging in everyday activities. The scene has a lively yet serene atmosphere, suggesting either a peaceful day in a traditional town or a moment of cultural celebration. The mountain in the background adds grandeur, while emphasizing the elevation of the main architectural focus.\n\nThe harmonious collision of natural beauty, cultural elements, and architectural craftsmanship makes this picture reminiscent of a fantastical or historical epic. It exudes a sense of beauty, tradition, and awe."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 832, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 224, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "bbda5e52ad580c13ceaa53136d9c2bed9137bd2e", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [547.519287109375, 262.80767822265625], "pos": [581.3153686523438, -203.38070678710938], "widgets_values": ["a digital painting depicting a bustling street scene in a traditional Chinese village, the scene is set against a backdrop of a majestic mountain range with snow-capped peaks, providing a stunning contrast to the ancient, multi-story pagoda-like structure in the center, the pagoda is intricately designed with pointed roofs and ornate architectural details, painted in shades of green and pink, and decorated with intricate patterns, the buildings on either side of the street are painted in traditional Chine